{"title":"1963 TMTA High School Algebra I Contest Problem 1","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1963_TMTA_High_School_Algebra_I_Contest_Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/0/9/4099f87ece8a9aed0cc6abbed35670f69e14aad0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4a - x = 3a - 4x,$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"140\" height=\"16\" /> then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/d/c/7dc22e8ecd41b9b99b767755fe41bd05d3e060cf.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x =$\" width=\"29\" height=\"8\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/7/e/f7e9f6d2242b45d04c924390546c2c929a447a67.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{(A)} \\quad -a \\quad \\text{(B)} \\quad 7a/5 \\quad \\text{(C)} \\quad a/5 \\quad \\text{(D)} \\quad -a/3 \\quad \\text{(E) NOTA}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"457\" height=\"18\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1963_TMTA_High_School_Algebra_I_Contest_Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Combine like terms: <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/a/2/2a20fb0616dbe9a0d3a52f23c2d27b6cd45b7db0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3x = -a.$\" width=\"70\" height=\"12\" /> We see that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/f/e/9fe85a64301cc34cc392729ae1612c02573791e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x = -\\frac{a}{3}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"61\" height=\"33\" /> and the answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/5/c/65cd215e7fc7eb8c86d72d653a4c76ee1158d85e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\text{(D)}}.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"40\" height=\"28\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1963_TMTA_High_School_Algebra_I_Contest_Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"clear:both; margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1963_TMTA_High_School_Mathematics_Contests\" title=\"1963 TMTA High School Mathematics Contests\">1963 TMTA High School Mathematics Contests</a> (<a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1963_TMTA_High_School_Algebra_I_Contest_Problems\" title=\"1963 TMTA High School Algebra I Contest Problems\">Problems</a>)</b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"30%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b>First Problem</b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"40%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=TMTA_High_School_Mathematics_Contest_Past_Problems/Solutions\" title=\"TMTA High School Mathematics Contest Past Problems/Solutions\">TMTA High School Mathematics Contest Past Problems/Solutions</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"30%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1963_TMTA_High_School_Algebra_I_Contest_Problem_2\" title=\"1963 TMTA High School Algebra I Contest Problem 2\"> Problem 2</a></b>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261017075507\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.011 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.016 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 59/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: